 OnClose←{
     ⍝ OnClose of HTMLRenderer created here: NewForm
     ⍝ ⎕WC callback for Close event on HTMLRenderer Form
     h←0⊃⍵
     d←h.Document
     0<≢d GetElementsByClass'DialogBox':0
     a←d.Application
     f←a.OnBeforeClose
     e←⎕NS''
     e.Event←'BeforeClose'
     e.Component←a
     e.Document←d
     _←f LogAbacusEvent e
     0=≢f:1⊣CloseApp h
     0⊣(⍎f)&e
 }
